# smplock.msg - text for the sample lock (smplock.ssl).
{100}{}{You see a sturdy lock. It is locked.}
{101}{}{You see a sturdy lock. It is unlocked.}
{102}{}{The lock is hand-made but solid. The keyhole is worn smooth from years of use.}

{110}{}{It is locked, and you do not have the key.}
{111}{}{The key turns. It is unlocked.}
{112}{}{You turn the key. It is locked again.}
{113}{}{Close it before you lock it.}

{120}{}{The lock clicks open under your fingers.}
{121}{}{You fail to pick the lock.}
{122}{}{Something snaps inside the lock. It is jammed.}
{123}{}{It is not locked.}

{130}{}{You find no traps.}
